# The nullables skill was restructured in "chore(nullables): upgrade skill to
# lexler rewrite", which renamed references/{architecture,building}/*.md into
# flat references/*.md files and dropped links.md and test-patterns.md.
# Unmanaging a file does not delete it, so without this the superseded copies
# linger next to the current ones on every machine that applied the old
# layout, where a glob of the skill directory still surfaces them. One of
# them documents createNull() returning a bag of trackers, which contradicts
# the rules in the current SKILL.md.
.claude/skills/nullables/links.md
